          %p
            Often it is useful to exhibit prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#G2StructureViaDefinite3Form"}
            in the following way.
          #DefiniteFormsInTermsOfVielbeinFields.num_example
            %h6#example Example
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
              a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/smooth+manifold"} smooth manifold
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/dimension"} dimension
              7, write
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Fr
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo →
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Fr(X) \to X
