                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \sigma_i \colon (U_i \subset X) \to Fr_O(X)
              of orthogonal frames, then the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback+of+differential+forms"} pullback of differential forms
            .maruku-equation
