                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G_2
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#Bryant05"} Bryant 05 (4.7)
          %h3#VariantsAndWeakenings Variants and weakenings
          %p
            There are several variants of the definition of
            = succeed "-manifolds," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
